#: confusb/componentes.py:544
msgid ""
"Notifies when a USB device is connected, shows its information and looks for "
"its driver and the applications to use it."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé fógra nuair a cheanglaítear gléas USB, taispeánann sé a eolas "
"agus lorgaíonn sé a thiománaí agus na feidhmchláir lena úsáid."

