#: confusb/kb.py:17
msgid "PC/SC service and CCID drivers"
msgstr "Seirbhís PC/SC agus tiománaithe CCID"

#: confusb/kb.py:18
msgid ""
"pcscd is the daemon that manages smart card readers; libccid provides the "
"driver for standard USB readers (CCID). Without pcscd the reader shows up in "
"USB but no application can use it."
msgstr ""
"Is é pcscd an deamhan a bhainistíonn léitheoirí cártaí cliste; soláthraíonn "
"libccid an tiománaí do ghnáthléitheoirí USB (CCID). Gan pcscd, feictear an "
"léitheoir sa USB ach ní féidir le feidhmchlár ar bith é a úsáid."

#: confusb/kb.py:22
msgid "OpenSC (PKCS#11, supports DNIe and other cards)"
msgstr "OpenSC (PKCS#11, tacaíonn sé leis an DNIe agus le cártaí eile)"

#: confusb/kb.py:23
msgid ""
"Library and tools for cryptographic cards. It includes support for the DNIe "
"(3.0/4.0) and the PKCS#11 module used by Firefox/Chromium and AutoFirma. "
"Older DNIe cards (2.0) may need the official DNIe module."
msgstr ""
"Leabharlann agus uirlisí do chártaí cripteagrafacha. Áirítear tacaíocht don "
"DNIe (3.0/4.0) agus an modúl PKCS#11 a úsáideann Firefox/Chromium agus "
"AutoFirma. D’fhéadfadh go mbeadh modúl oifigiúil an DNIe de dhíth ar DNIe "
"níos sine (2.0)."

#: confusb/kb.py:26
msgid "List readers"
msgstr "Liostaigh na léitheoirí"

#: confusb/kb.py:27
msgid "Card info (ATR)"
msgstr "Eolas faoin gcárta (ATR)"

#: confusb/kb.py:28
msgid "List PKCS#11 slots"
msgstr "Liostaigh sliotáin PKCS#11"

#: confusb/kb.py:29
msgid "List certificates"
msgstr "Liostaigh deimhnithe"

#: confusb/kb.py:34
msgid "pcsc-tools (reader and card monitor)"
msgstr "pcsc-tools (monatóir léitheoirí agus cártaí)"

#: confusb/kb.py:35
msgid ""
"pcsc_scan shows in real time when a card is inserted or removed and decodes "
"its ATR."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann pcsc_scan i bhfíor-am nuair a chuirtear cárta isteach nó nuair a "
"bhainfear amach é, agus díchódaíonn sé a ATR."

#: confusb/kb.py:37
msgid "Open pcsc_scan"
msgstr "Oscail pcsc_scan"

#: confusb/kb.py:40
msgid "AutoFirma (electronic signature)"
msgstr "AutoFirma (síniú leictreonach)"

#: confusb/kb.py:41
msgid ""
"Official Spanish Government application to sign documents with the DNIe or a "
"digital certificate. It is not in the Debian repositories: it is downloaded "
"from firmaelectronica.gob.es."
msgstr ""
"Feidhmchlár oifigiúil Rialtas na Spáinne chun doiciméid a shíniú leis an "
"DNIe nó le deimhniú digiteach. Níl sé i stórais Debian: íoslódáiltear é ó "
"firmaelectronica.gob.es."

